{
  "challenges": [
    {
      "publicId": "chal_coding_pat_122",
      "name": "response-schema-validator",
      "type": "mini_coding",
      "title": "Check whole responses against their schema",
      "description": "The courier app crashed twice on responses the suite called fine: `total` sent as a string, and `courier` null on an unassigned order. The editor holds `schema_check.py`: `validate(schema, value)` with its rule blocks missing, each marked by a `# [ ]` line; some pieces are wrong on purpose. Fill every line so that a response is checked against the whole schema (a JSON Schema / OpenAPI 3.1 subset): JSON types (true is a boolean, not an integer; nullable types), required properties (null is present, not missing), nested properties and arrays, properties that are not allowed, enums, minimums and RFC 3339 date-times with an offset. Every problem is reported with its path, in the order the file's docstring gives. Run checks real and broken order responses.",
      "difficulty": "medium",
      "outcomes": [
        "test-design"
      ],
      "points": 30,
      "hints": [
        "Walk one response by hand: the path grows by `.name` for properties and `[i]` for array elements, and a value of the wrong type ends the checks for that value.",
        "Look at the order of the `isinstance` checks in `json_type` (Python's `bool` is a subclass of `int`), at the difference between a key that is absent and a key whose value is `None`, and at what the date-time pattern requires after the seconds.",
        "A check of a `rating` object with a nullable comment looks like: `validate({\"type\": \"object\", \"required\": [\"stars\", \"comment\"], \"properties\": {\"stars\": {\"type\": \"integer\", \"minimum\": 1}, \"comment\": {\"type\": [\"string\", \"null\"]}}}, {\"stars\": 0, \"comment\": None})` -> `[\"$.stars: 0 is below the minimum 1\"]`."
      ],
      "coding": {
        "language": "python",
        "filePath": "schema_check.py",
        "executionMode": "stdio",
        "timeLimitMs": 3000,
        "memoryLimitMb": 128,
        "scoringMode": "all_or_nothing",
        "maxAttempts": null
      },
      "tests": [
        {
          "name": "A complete order and an order nobody has picked up yet (courier null) both pass",
          "input": {
            "schema": {
              "type": "object",
              "required": [
                "id",
                "status",
                "total",
                "items",
                "courier",
                "placed_at"
              ],
              "properties": {
                "id": {
                  "type": "integer",
                  "minimum": 1
                },
                "status": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "enum": [
                    "placed",
                    "cooking",
                    "on_the_way",
                    "delivered",
                    "cancelled"
                  ]
                },
                "total": {
                  "type": "integer",
                  "minimum": 0
                },
                "items": {
                  "type": "array",
                  "items": {
                    "type": "object",
                    "required": [
                      "name",
                      "quantity",
                      "price"
                    ],
                    "properties": {
                      "name": {
                        "type": "string"
                      },
                      "quantity": {
                        "type": "integer",
                        "minimum": 1
                      },
                      "price": {
                        "type": "integer",
                        "minimum": 0
                      }
                    }
                  }
                },
                "courier": {
                  "type": [
                    "object",
                    "null"
                  ],
                  "required": [
                    "id",
                    "name"
                  ],
                  "additionalProperties": false,
                  "properties": {
                    "id": {
                      "type": "integer"
                    },
                    "name": {
                      "type": "string"
                    }
                  }
                },
                "placed_at": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "format": "date-time"
                }
              }
            },
            "responses": {
              "assigned": {
                "id": 91822,
                "status": "on_the_way",
                "total": 125000,
                "items": [
                  {
                    "name": "Com tam suon",
                    "quantity": 2,
